{"title":"1972 IMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be real-valued functions defined for all real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and satisfying the equation\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/f/97f8d013a410592034cbfed478e6a77b6573100d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x + y) + f(x - y) = 2f(x)g(y)\\]\" width=\"256\" height=\"18\" />\nfor all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/5/32581661cddf01ad30c1e36efe72f99eb0a0adca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" />. Prove that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is not identically zero, and if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/d/c1d7f4ed9016c55de1e35192376ccec1f9333e9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|f(x)| \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/0/3d0e3834db44e9e7011635db4ee0b30c1bea238f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|g(y)| \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/d/b9d967db647ded0a16fb16f5ed82e75660884b46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> be the least upper bound for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/a/43a205879f624365c1c1773c849be4c20594794f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|f(x)|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/4/0747319e60db6ed71803df31f0b923d874ef830c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|f(x)| \\leq u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Then, for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/4/b6400c6fe3f1ed70e5afd387a9686cdc3fa09531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/8/fe89d82e9e897eab4abbb2435ae52a68fb2f7f70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2u \\geq |f(x+y)+f(x-y)| = |2f(x)g(y)|=2|f(x)||g(y)|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"442\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/7/fd7b0821c317c8038b38cba640404246d2effce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u \\geq |f(x)||g(y)|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/0/1e0b2ffb98e95882ad94709f023419444e3856d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|f(x)| \\leq u/|g(y)|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad99798ec4c38e165cf517cb9e02b1c9e824103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is the least upper bound for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/a/43a205879f624365c1c1773c849be4c20594794f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|f(x)|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/d/26d1aff4a5349b3ddb8923a210e193208260b91b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u/|g(y)| \\geq u$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/0/3d0e3834db44e9e7011635db4ee0b30c1bea238f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|g(y)| \\leq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Borrowed from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.cs.cornell.edu/~asdas/imo/imo/isoln/isoln725.html\">[1]</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_IMO\" title=\"1972 IMO\">1972 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1972 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1972 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1972 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1972 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1972 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1972 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1972 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1972_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1972 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016202757\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 126/1000000\nPo